Last but not least, Yakan-kun will give you a cup of tea to cheer you up!

8
00:00:37,776 --> 00:00:38,936
Do you usually drink tea?

9
00:00:38,936 --> 00:00:41,616
Oh, I drink green tea every day!

10
00:00:41,616 --> 00:00:42,616
Really?

11
00:00:42,616 --> 00:00:43,116
Yes, I do.

12
00:00:43,116 --> 00:00:46,336
Today's tea is a quick green tea!

13
00:00:46,336 --> 00:00:47,536
Wow!

14
00:00:48,096 --> 00:00:50,736
Wow! Thank you! Bon appétit!

15
00:00:50,736 --> 00:00:52,016
Thank you!

16
00:00:55,066 --> 00:00:59,066
Oh, it's so good! It's so relaxing!

17
00:00:59,066 --> 00:01:01,066
I don't know, it has less bitterness.

18
00:01:01,066 --> 00:01:05,066
It's so easy to drink! It's so good!

19
00:01:05,066 --> 00:01:07,066
Good, good, good!

20
00:01:07,066 --> 00:01:10,066
I'm glad to hear that you've had Yama-chan's!

21
00:01:10,066 --> 00:01:14,066
Now, I'm sorry to leave you with this, but I'm going to end on a cute note!

22
00:01:14,066 --> 00:01:15,066
Yes!

23
00:01:15,066 --> 00:01:18,066
Can I ask you to close for the camera?

24
00:01:18,066 --> 00:01:19,066
Yes!

25
00:01:20,688 --> 00:01:30,568
Next time, please let us do a comedy like "All hands on deck at 8 o'clock"! Thank you very much, this is Shiritsu Ebisugaku no Katamimi no Naka.

